# Research factory: heavy/reproducible parquets stay out of git.
# Kept: all code, ledgers (STATE/HYPOTHESES/EXPERIMENTS), reports, summaries (md/json/csv),
# and certified evidence events_topN.parquet under certification_2025-*/.
# Excluded: ranked_*.parquet (reproducible), legacy events_all*, per-signal result dumps.
factory/artifacts/ranked_*.parquet
factory/artifacts/events_all*.parquet
factory/artifacts/events_2025-*.parquet
factory/artifacts/h00*_results*.parquet
factory/artifacts/h0*/**/*.parquet
